"body": {"content": [{"endIndex": 1, "sectionBreak": {"sectionStyle": {"columnSeparatorStyle": "NONE", "contentDirection": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "sectionType": "CONTINUOUS"}}}, {"endIndex": 14, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 14, "startIndex": 1, "textRun": {"content": "Nos missions\n", "textStyle": {"bold": true, "fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "underline": true, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spaceAbove": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "spaceBelow": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 1}, {"endIndex": 38, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 38, "startIndex": 14, "textRun": {"content": "DÉVELOPPEMENT PERSONNEL\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.6431373, "green": 0.21960784, "red": 1}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spaceAbove": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "spaceBelow": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 14}, {"endIndex": 480, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 480, "startIndex": 38, "textRun": {"content": "A travers une boxe adaptée, il s’agit de réconcilier le patient avec son mental et son corps. Lâcher les coups pour mieux se libérer du cancer. Il s’agit de ne plus subir la maladie, mais bien de se reconstruire à travers la boxe. Reprendre confiance en soi, l’estime de soi mais aussi se valoriser et développer le dépassement de soi . Ainsi en passant par ce sport, nous pouvons y retrouver tous ces bénéfices pour reprendre goût à la vie.\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spaceAbove": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "spaceBelow": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 38}, {"endIndex": 504, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 504, "startIndex": 480, "textRun": {"content": " DÉVELOPPEMENT PHYSIQUE\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.6431373, "green": 0.21960784, "red": 1}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spaceAbove": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "spaceBelow": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 480}, {"endIndex": 850, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 850, "startIndex": 504, "textRun": {"content": "Abattu et peu confiant, le patient n’exerce plus d’effort physique, ce qui engendre une prise de poids mais aussi un affaiblissement musculaire dû à une hospitalisation trop longue et aux traitements de chimiothérapie. Nous proposons donc par la boxe adaptée un renforcement musculaire et une stimulation de la mémoire par les gestes répétitifs.\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spaceAbove": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "spaceBelow": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 504}, {"endIndex": 871, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 871, "startIndex": 850, "textRun": {"content": "DÉVELOPPEMENT SOCIAL\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.6431373, "green": 0.21960784, "red": 1}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spaceAbove": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "spaceBelow": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 850}, {"endIndex": 1156, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 1156, "startIndex": 871, "textRun": {"content": "Se remettre dans la vie sociale et active pour les patients mais aussi créer des liens et des échanges. Établir des relations au sein du groupe et engendrer non seulement de la motivation mais aussi de l’entraide et du soutien. Ne plus être seul face à la maladie, ne plus être isolé.\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spaceAbove": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "spaceBelow": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 871}, {"endIndex": 1157, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 1157, "startIndex": 1156, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"}}, "startIndex": 1156}]},
